# devDependencies are REQUIRED to build, test and lint this project: vite, the
# test runner and the gate scripts all live there. `npm install` must therefore
# install them.
#
# npm reads a user-level ~/.npmrc and the NODE_ENV environment variable as well
# as this file, and either can carry `omit=dev` / `production=true` — commonly
# set once for deploying something else and then forgotten. When that happens a
# plain `npm install` in this repo silently PRUNES the dev tree: on the machine
# this was written on it removed 82 packages including vite, and the build
# stayed broken until they were reinstalled.
#
# This file is more specific than the user-level one, so it wins here without
# touching anything else on the machine.
omit=
